OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny mist or fog patches soon
OL,6,Fclearing. A fine day follows, with
OL,7,Fvariable and often large amounts of
OL,8,Fcloud, but also occasional sunny
OL,9,Fspells. Feeling warm, especially in
OL,10,Fthe sunshine, with only light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud thickening overnight,
OL,13,Fwith outbreaks of rain spreading
OL,14,Fnorth. These becoming widespread and
OL,15,Fpersistent after midnight, and heavy
OL,16,Fat times. Eastern coasts perhaps
OL,17,Fstaying a little drier. Mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
